{"seq":2,"slug":"green-transition","title":"绿色转型路径","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/economics/frontier-economics/climate-economics/green-transition","wordCount":2519,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"绿色转型路径\">绿色转型路径</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>绿色转型的经济学核心问题不仅仅是&quot;减少多少碳排放&quot;，而是&quot;技术变迁的方向能否被系统性地引导&quot;。传统增长理论假设技术进步是外生的或方向中立的，但气候政策面对的现实恰恰相反——化石能源体系经过两百年的累积投资，形成了深厚的路径依赖和碳锁定效应。打破这种锁定需要的不仅是碳定价，还需要理解定向技术变迁的内在逻辑、产业政策的经济学基础，以及搁浅资产引发的金融风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"定向技术变迁理论\">定向技术变迁理论</h3><p>Acemoglu et al. (2012) 将定向技术变迁理论（Directed Technical Change）应用于气候问题，构建了一个两部门模型：清洁部门和污染部门各自有专用的创新路径。关键洞见是技术变迁存在<strong>路径依赖</strong>——当污染部门的技术存量远大于清洁部门时，市场力量会继续将创新资源导向污染部门，因为污染技术的边际生产力更高。</p>\n<p>模型的核心结构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>Y</mi><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>Y</mi><mi>d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y = \\left( Y_c^{(\\varepsilon-1)/\\varepsilon} + Y_d^{(\\varepsilon-1)/\\varepsilon} \\right)^{\\varepsilon/(\\varepsilon-1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0779em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是清洁部门和污染部门的产出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 是两部门之间的替代弹性。每个部门的生产依赖于专用的中间品种类数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msubsup><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>α</mi></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_j = L_j^{1-\\alpha} \\int_0^{A_j} x_{ji}^\\alpha di, \\quad j \\in \\{c, d\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5032em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.433em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4031em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5912em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>创新者选择在哪个部门研发，取决于相对利润——利润又取决于市场规模效应（更大的部门有更多需求）和价格效应（更稀缺的技术有更高的单位利润）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[定向技术变迁] --&gt; B[市场规模效应]&#10;    A --&gt; C[价格效应]&#10;    B --&gt; D[污染部门技术存量大]&#10;    D --&gt; E[创新偏向污染部门]&#10;    E --&gt; F[碳锁定加深]&#10;    C --&gt; G[碳价提高清洁技术回报]&#10;    G --&gt; H[创新转向清洁部门]&#10;    H --&gt; I[绿色转型启动]\">graph TD\n    A[定向技术变迁] --&gt; B[市场规模效应]\n    A --&gt; C[价格效应]\n    B --&gt; D[污染部门技术存量大]\n    D --&gt; E[创新偏向污染部门]\n    E --&gt; F[碳锁定加深]\n    C --&gt; G[碳价提高清洁技术回报]\n    G --&gt; H[创新转向清洁部门]\n    H --&gt; I[绿色转型启动]</pre><p><strong>政策含义</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（两部门高度可替代）时，临时性的碳税和研发补贴就足以将技术变迁的方向从污染转向清洁——一旦清洁技术的存量积累超过临界点，市场力量会自动维持绿色创新的方向。但当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时，转型需要更持久和更强力的政策干预。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碳锁定与路径依赖\">碳锁定与路径依赖</h3><p>碳锁定（Carbon Lock-in）描述的是化石能源体系通过多层级的正反馈机制抵抗转型的现象。Unruh (2000) 将其分为三个层面：</p>\n<p><strong>技术层面</strong>：化石能源基础设施的使用寿命通常为 30-60 年（燃煤电厂 40 年，输油管道 50 年）。一旦建成，这些资产的边际运行成本极低，即使碳价升高也不足以让它们提前退役。全球现有化石能源基础设施如果运营至设计寿命，将排放约 660 GtCO₂——超过 1.5°C 碳预算的 80%。</p>\n<p><strong>制度层面</strong>：围绕化石能源形成的法规体系、行业标准、劳动力技能、税收优惠——这些制度安排共同构成了转型的&quot;制度惯性&quot;。例如，化石燃料补贴在全球仍高达每年 $7 万亿（IMF, 2023，含隐性补贴）。</p>\n<p><strong>行为层面</strong>：消费者习惯和认知偏误加深锁定。现状偏误（Status Quo Bias）使消费者倾向于维持现有能源选择；双曲贴现（Hyperbolic Discounting）使消费者低估能效投资的长期回报。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>行为折价</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>saved</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>energy</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>implicit</mtext></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{行为折价} = \\frac{E_{\\text{saved}} \\cdot p_{\\text{energy}}}{(1 + r_{\\text{implicit}})^T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">行为折价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">implicit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7673em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">saved</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">energy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>研究发现消费者对能效投资的隐含贴现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>implicit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{implicit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">implicit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 高达 30-50%，远高于资本市场利率——这就是所谓的&quot;能效差距&quot;（Energy Efficiency Gap）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"绿色产业政策\">绿色产业政策</h3><p>碳定价是必要的但不充分的。绿色产业政策的经济学基础超越了传统的&quot;选优胜者&quot;（picking winners）争论，建立在以下市场失灵的叠加上：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>外部性叠加</strong>：碳排放的环境外部性 + 知识溢出的研发外部性 + 学习曲线的部署外部性</li>\n<li><strong>协调失灵</strong>：清洁能源的基础设施（充电网络、氢能管道）和终端应用（电动车、氢能冶金）之间存在鸡生蛋问题</li>\n<li><strong>资本市场失灵</strong>：清洁技术投资面临更高的感知风险，特别是在项目融资阶段</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[绿色产业政策工具] --&gt; B[供给侧]&#10;    A --&gt; C[需求侧]&#10;    A --&gt; D[系统层面]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[研发补贴]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[税收优惠]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[绿色金融]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[公共采购]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[可再生能源配额]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[碳差价合约 CCfD]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[基础设施投资]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[技能培训]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[标准与规制]\">graph LR\n    A[绿色产业政策工具] --&gt; B[供给侧]\n    A --&gt; C[需求侧]\n    A --&gt; D[系统层面]\n    B --&gt; B1[研发补贴]\n    B --&gt; B2[税收优惠]\n    B --&gt; B3[绿色金融]\n    C --&gt; C1[公共采购]\n    C --&gt; C2[可再生能源配额]\n    C --&gt; C3[碳差价合约 CCfD]\n    D --&gt; D1[基础设施投资]\n    D --&gt; D2[技能培训]\n    D --&gt; D3[标准与规制]</pre><p><strong>学习曲线与部署补贴</strong>：太阳能光伏的成本下降是学习曲线的教科书案例。Wright&#39;s Law 描述的经验规律是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(X) = C_0 \\cdot X^{-\\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 是累计产量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是学习率参数。光伏的学习率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx 0.36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.36</span></span></span></span></span>（每翻倍产量成本下降约 22%）。1976-2023 年，光伏组件价格从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>106</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi><mtext>降至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">106/W 降至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">106/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">降至</span></span></span></span></span>0.13/W——降幅超过 99%。</p>\n<p>德国的 FIT（上网电价）政策和中国的光伏制造补贴被认为是加速这一学习曲线的关键驱动力。但争论在于：这些补贴的净社会收益是正的吗？Gerarden (2023) 估计美国的清洁能源部署补贴的社会回报率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mtext>每</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4-7 每</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每</span></span></span></span></span>1 补贴——但这一估计高度敏感于 SCC 的取值和学习率的假设。</p>\n<p><strong>碳差价合约（Carbon Contracts for Difference, CCfD）</strong>：欧盟和英国推出的创新政策工具。政府与绿色投资者签订长期合约，承诺如果碳价低于约定的&quot;执行价格&quot;（strike price），政府补足差价；如果碳价高于执行价格，投资者退还差额。这消除了碳价波动带来的投资不确定性，尤其适用于绿色氢能、碳捕获等前沿技术。</p>\n<h3 id=\"搁浅资产与金融风险\">搁浅资产与金融风险</h3><p>绿色转型意味着化石能源资产在到达设计寿命之前就失去经济价值——这就是搁浅资产（Stranded Assets）问题。Carbon Tracker Initiative 估计，如果全球遵循 2°C 路径，已探明化石燃料储量中约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的煤炭、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的天然气和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{4}{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的石油必须留在地下。</p>\n<p>搁浅资产的金融传导机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传导链条</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>化石能源公司估值下降</td>\n<td>股东损失、养老基金受损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贷款违约增加</td>\n<td>银行资产质量恶化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主权风险上升</td>\n<td>资源依赖国信用评级下调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保险赔付增加</td>\n<td>极端气候事件频率上升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>央行与金融监管的角色</strong>：英格兰银行率先提出气候压力测试（Climate Stress Test），要求金融机构评估不同气候情景（有序转型、无序转型、不转型）下的资产组合损失。NGFS（央行与监管机构绿色金融网络）提供了标准化的气候情景框架。</p>\n<p><strong>转型风险悖论</strong>：越是延迟行动，未来所需的减排速度越快，搁浅资产的规模和速度越大——这形成了一个正反馈循环。Carney (2015) 将此称为&quot;地平线的悲剧&quot;（Tragedy of the Horizon）——气候变化的时间尺度超出了商业周期、政治周期和央行任期的典型视野。</p>\n<h3 id=\"公正转型\">公正转型</h3><p>绿色转型不是帕累托改进——它将创造赢家（清洁能源行业、科技工人）和输家（化石能源工人、资源型社区）。公正转型（Just Transition）框架要求在政策设计中显式考虑分配效应：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>劳动力转移</strong>：煤矿工人向可再生能源行业的再培训——但技能不匹配和地理分布差异使这一过程远非无摩擦</li>\n<li><strong>区域再开发</strong>：资源型城市需要新的经济支柱——德国鲁尔区的转型用了 40 年</li>\n<li><strong>补偿机制</strong>：碳税收入的再分配——加拿大的碳退税（Carbon Rebate）直接将碳税收入按人头返还给居民</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在 Acemoglu 定向技术变迁模型中，如果清洁和污染部门的替代弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>（低替代弹性），临时性碳税能否启动绿色转型？如果不能，需要什么额外政策？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>分析中国光伏产业的崛起：政府补贴在加速学习曲线方面的作用有多大？如果没有补贴，光伏成本达到电网平价（grid parity）需要多长时间？讨论估计的不确定性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个搁浅资产压力测试：你是某银行的风险分析师，银行对煤电行业的贷款敞口为 100 亿元。在&quot;2030 年碳价升至 $100&quot;情景下，估计不良贷款率的上升幅度。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>批判性分析&quot;公正转型&quot;：德国关闭核电站而延长煤电使用的决策是否符合绿色转型的逻辑？从碳排放、能源安全和政治经济学三个维度讨论。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Acemoglu, D. et al. (2012)</strong>. &quot;The Environment and Directed Technical Change&quot;. <em>American Economic Review</em>. 定向技术变迁应用于气候问题的奠基论文。</li>\n<li><strong>Unruh, G. C. (2000)</strong>. &quot;Understanding Carbon Lock-in&quot;. <em>Energy Policy</em>. 碳锁定概念的经典文献。</li>\n<li><strong>Carbon Tracker Initiative</strong> (carbontracker.org)：搁浅资产分析的领先智库，报告和数据免费获取。</li>\n<li><strong>IRENA (2024)</strong>. <em>Renewable Power Generation Costs</em>. 可再生能源成本数据的权威年度报告。</li>\n<li><strong>Stern, N. &amp; Stiglitz, J. (2023)</strong>. &quot;Climate Change and Growth&quot;. <em>Industrial and Corporate Change</em>. 关于绿色增长可行性的最新理论综述。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>绿色转型的经济学挑战远超&quot;碳定价&quot;一个工具所能承载。定向技术变迁理论揭示了市场力量在路径依赖下可能持续偏向污染技术的内在逻辑——打破碳锁定需要碳价、研发补贴和部署政策的组合拳。学习曲线的经验证据（特别是光伏）表明，早期的政策干预可以启动自我强化的成本下降循环。但转型也带来搁浅资产的金融风险和分配公平的社会挑战——忽视这些维度的政策不仅在伦理上不可接受，在政治上也不可持续。公正转型不是绿色政策的&quot;附加条款&quot;，而是其政治可行性的核心条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"绿色转型路径","id":"绿色转型路径"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"定向技术变迁理论","id":"定向技术变迁理论"},{"level":3,"text":"碳锁定与路径依赖","id":"碳锁定与路径依赖"},{"level":3,"text":"绿色产业政策","id":"绿色产业政策"},{"level":3,"text":"搁浅资产与金融风险","id":"搁浅资产与金融风险"},{"level":3,"text":"公正转型","id":"公正转型"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"碳定价模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/economics/frontier-economics/climate-economics/carbon-pricing-models"},"next":{"title":"气候正义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/economics/frontier-economics/climate-economics/climate-justice"}}